Cell["\<\
Generic ReduceSpinContractions is the only optional input preparation. Raw, \
prepared, and output expressions are retained separately. Limits are Wolfram \
time constraints, not external watchdogs: a stuck native library may still \
require terminating the kernel. Reload Setup after replacing the model. No \
model is trained or saved by this notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cda1f5e9-5c16-4b83-958c-0a24b75eeb2c"]
}, Open  ]],

